Hanan Almukhalfi is a Master’s student and lecturer in the Department of Computer Science, College of Computer Science and Engineering, Taibah University. Her current research interests include Artificial Intelligence and IoT. She earned a Bachelor in Computer Science from the College of Computer Science and Engineering from Taibah University, Madinah, SA in 2011. Contact her at hmukhalfi@taibahu.edu.sa.
Ayman Noor is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Computer Science, Madinah branch at Taibah University, Saudi Arabia. Dr. Noor is currently HoD of Computer Science. His research interests include Cloud Computing, Monitoring Performance, Big Data Analytics, Artificial Intelligence, and Blockchain. Dr. Noor received his Ph.D. from the School of Computing Science, Newcastle University, United Kingdom in 2021. He earned a Master of Science in Computer and Information Science from Gannon University, Pennsylvania, United States of America in 2013. Contact him at anoor@taibahu.edu.sa.
Talal.H. Noor is an Associate Professor and applied college branch executive manager, Badr branch at Taibah University, Saudi Arabia. His research interests include Services Computing, Security and Privacy, Trust Management, Social Computing, Artificial Intelligence, and Human-Computer Interaction. Noor received a PhD in computer science from the University of Adelaide, Australia. He is a member of IEEE. Contact him at tnoor@taibahu.edu.sa.